# ==============================================================================
# CURSOR SYSTEM RULE: AUTOMATIC WP PLUGIN VERSION INCREMENT
# ==============================================================================

# Target File: C:\work\wp-seo-ai\omi-seo-ai-bridge.php (or the main plugin header file)

When making modifications, adding features, or fixing bugs in any file inside the "wp-seo-ai" directory:

1. Always locate the main plugin file: "omi-seo-ai-bridge.php".
2. Read the current version from the header comment line, for example:
   * "Version: 1.0.4"
3. Auto-increment this version number based on semantic versioning rules (Patch level by default, e.g. from 1.0.4 to 1.0.5) before writing or completing any code edits.
4. Update the "Version" field in the comment block at the top of "omi-seo-ai-bridge.php" to match the new version.
5. In your response chat, always state: "Đã tự động nâng cấp phiên bản lên <new_version> trong file omi-seo-ai-bridge.php".
6. Remind the user to run the packaging PowerShell script:
   * "Vui lòng thực thi lệnh: `.\compress_plugin.ps1` để đóng gói và đồng bộ bản cập nhật lên Laravel Update Server."
